    <briefdescription>
<para>Variant of <computeroutput><ref refid="class_our_queue_configuration" kindref="compound">OurQueueConfiguration</ref></computeroutput> with deduplication enabled, used by <computeroutput><ref refid="_n_c_reduction_8cpp_ae95cf11c1c4031885ef1af1621466c50_1ae95cf11c1c4031885ef1af1621466c50" kindref="member">makeQueue1()</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput>deduplicate(a, b)</computeroutput> returns <computeroutput>a + b + 1000</computeroutput>, a sentinel value chosen so that the geobucket can be observed to call into the deduplicate path during testing. Like its sibling, this configuration is scaffolding rather than a real reduction backend. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
